category: Devel
build-depends: cygport lua5.1-devel
sdesc: "Tool to integrate C/Cpp code with Lua (utilities)"
ldesc: "tolua++ is an extension of toLua, a tool to integrate C/C++ code with Lua.
tolua++ includes new features oriented to c++, such as class templates."
